## Development

Requires Python 3.11 or newer.

```sh
python -m venv .venv
# Activate .venv using the command for your shell.
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
python -m pytest
python -m ruff check .
python -m ruff format --check .
python -m mypy src
python -m build
```

Import the package with `import [[ package_name ]]`.

## Template updates

Commit your changes, including `.copier-answers.yml`, before updating.
Use the gh-project-scaffold `update --preview` command to review upstream changes.
Resolve any conflicts before accepting an update.

## Releases

The bundled workflow tests and builds distributions for `v*` tags.
Its artifacts are available in GitHub Actions; package publishing is not enabled.
